    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Mullery O’Gara are delighted to present to the market Apartment 6 Harmac Court, a bright & spacious first floor apartment located in a small development of just 12 units. \r\n\r\nA much sought after residential road between the villages of Rathgar and Terenure with a host of amenities and bus routes on your doorstep. \r\n\r\nAccommodation comprises an entrance hall with hot press, a bright living room featuring a large window overlooking Brighton Avenue and a separate kitchen fitted with a range of units, sink, hob, oven and extractor fan. The double bedroom includes fitted wardrobes, while the main bathroom offers a bath with a Mira electric shower attachment, w.c. and whb. The apartment enjoys excellent natural light throughout, enhanced by large west-facing windows.\r\n\r\nThere is a communal locker room on the top floor and a communal Laundry Room on the first floor. To the rear of the block is a bicycle shed, designated storage space with communal gardens. To the front is a large court yard with one designated car parking space and a number of visitors spaces.  \r\n\r\nWonderfully positioned within minutes walking distance to a wide selection of shops, cafes, bars, beside bus routes, schools, sports facilities. Numerous bus routes are available on Harold’s Cross Road linking into the city centre and further afield. The property is also convenient to the M50 and Dundrum Town Centre."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall: \r\n\r\nLiving/ Dining (3.4m x 3.9m)\r\nLarge window overlooking front of development  \r\n\r\nKitchen (2m x 3.8m)\r\nRange of fitted units, sink unit, oven & hob, tiled splashback. \r\n\r\nBedroom (2.6m x 4.8m)\r\nFitted wardrobes \r\n\r\nBathroom (1.7m x 3.8)\r\nBath with mira shower attachment, w.c, whb, mirror, tiled floor and partly tiled walls, hot press. \r\n\r\nCommunal Areas: \r\nThere is a communal locker room on the top floor and a communal laundry room on the first floor. \r\n\r\nOutside: To the rear of the block is a bicycle shed, designated storage space with communal gardens. To the front is a courtyard with one designated car parking space and a number of visitors spaces"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "c. 510 SqFt / 47 SqM\r\nDesignated parking space \r\nWest facing \r\nDouble Glazed windows throughout \r\nElectric Heating\r\nStorage area and Communal locker\r\nSeparate laundry room\r\nManagement fee c. €1,920 per annum \r\nBeside Rathgar, Harold’s Cross and Terenure villages\r\nWalking distance to numerous bus routes \r\nConvenient M50 and city centre"
      },
